# Deathless Pilot: "{3}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to your hand" works only from the graveyard (CR 113.6k):
# on the battlefield it is refused, though a thousand mana would not offer it either. Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the
# Pilot on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 has Moxen Jet, Pearl and Ruby: three mana, one short (the refusal with `Mana: short`);
# casting Mox Sapphire makes four, which pays it exactly - the pool is empty after - and the card is back in hand.

